<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TASMANIAN WOMEN'S INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>Tasmanian Women's International tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Third round  </p>
<p>Annabel Ellwood (Australia) beat Siobhan Drake-Brockman</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-2 6-4.</p>
<p>6-Shi-Ting Wang (Tapei) beat Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat 1-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 1-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 0-2 forfeit</p>
<p>Mana Endo (Japan) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
